	<p align="justify"><font color="#FFFFFF">Le mob spawn près du monument squatté par les shadow men. Il est mieux de les tuer avant de faire poper l'esprit...<BR><BR><center><img src=http://home.cox.rr.com/mup/bst/images/lfay-scout.jpg></center><BR><BR><b>Donner le seal au scout</b><BR><i>Scout Rahjiq says 'Keep your head down, mate! The spirit that you have come for is very close. I have spotted it several times today. It keeps appearing near that odd structure just over the hill. Be careful not to attract the attention of those invisible creatures that roam near the structure. Just release the spirit and return the totem to me. I'll prepare the totem for placement in the container that you were given.</i><BR><BR><b>The air before the large monolith grows solid, as misty tendrils wrap together in the shape of a large wolf. </b><BR><BR><center><a target=blank href=http://home.cox.rr.com/mup/bst/images/lf-mob.jpg><img src=http://home.cox.rr.com/mup/bst/images/lf-mob-sm.jpg></a></center><BR><BR><u>Infos : </u><BR><BR>Nom : Spirit of Malevolence <BR>Level : 55<BR>Resistances :<BR>- Magie : Très haute (moyenne après Malo)<BR>- Feu : Faible<BR>- Froid : Faible<BR>- Poison : Très haute (moyenne après malo)<BR>- Immune to changes in attack speed<BR>Combat Ability: Flurries<BR>Special Ability: Aveuglement en proc sur sa cible (proc souvent)<BR>Vie : moyenne plus<BR><BR><b>Donner le totem au scout</b><BR><i>Scout Rahjiq wraps the totem and returns it with the seal you gave him and says, 'That spirit was very powerful. I'm glad that you were able to release it. Please keep this totem safe until you can return to Shar Vahl. Once you collect all of the totems, seal the box and return it to your master. May the spirits watch over you!</i><BR><BR>Le scout rends alors le seal qui servira au prochain combat ainsi qu'un totem qui doit etre placé dans la boite</font></p><br><br>

